    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I suspected the autonomy stuff was a factor. Aside from the autonomy issue, were there any specific complaints or criticisms shared in the private feedback sessions that haven't come up in the group meetings? I want to make sure we aren't walking into a trap by ignoring something more personal.",
